}, "Restore officers' authority; keep the committees only for supply");
!}

Officers regained their authority over operational orders. The committees have been told to concern themselves with food and boots.



@authority_force
choose-if: strength >= 18
subtitle: Chance of breaking its opponents: generals [+ odds_gen +]%. A camp under 45% is too strong to touch, and is left alone.
unavailable-subtitle: We lack the force and the allies to break the opposition.
