@death_penalty

How should it be carried out? Phased in, with compensation and negotiation, it will cost a resource, do less and anger less. By decree it will do all that it says, and its opponents will answer. And a party strong enough can pass it and enforce it against them.

- @death_penalty_slow: Phase it in, with compensation and negotiation.
- @death_penalty_decree: Pass it by decree, as written.
- @death_penalty_force: Pass it by decree, and break any opposition by force.

@death_penalty_slow
choose-if: resources >= 1
subtitle: Milder effects and little anger. Costs 1 resource.
unavailable-subtitle: We have nothing to pay the compensation with.
on-arrival: {!

RO.law(Q, 'slow', () => {
RO.add(Q, {army_discipline: 8, bolshevik: 4, rel_kad: 4, right_threat: 3});
RO.boost(Q, {soldiers: -6, workers: -2});
RO.fac(Q, 'intl', 0, 8);
RO.fac(Q, 'defencist', 0, 2);
}, "Restore the death penalty at the front");
!}

The death penalty at the front was restored for desertion and treason. The Bolshevik press called it "the gallows of the Menshevik ministers". It was phased in slowly, with compensation where it was owed, and the opposition grumbled rather than raged.



